{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00313","headline":"惜花吟 · 鲍氏君徽","name":"惜花吟","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"枝上花，花下人，可怜颜色俱青春。\n昨日看花花灼灼，今朝看花花欲落。\n不如尽此花下欢，莫待春风总吹却。\n莺歌蝶舞韶光长，红炉煑茗松花香。\n妆成罢吟恣游後，独把芳枝归洞房。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"鲍氏君徽","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00313.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00313","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}